<p>You fire countless shots into the sky to rain down around your target, inflicting <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">95%, 110%, 121%, 131%, 140%</acronym> weapon damage to all within radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 2, 3, 3, 4.</acronym></p><p>If the primary target is marked, you consume the mark to fire a second volley of arrows for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">71%, 82%, 91%, 98%, 105%</acronym> damage at no ammo cost.</p>